      nodeId: goenitz.ultimate.lv4
      nodeName: Yamidokoku Ascension
      description: During either Ultimate, self is immune to damage and debuffs.
        Ultimate kills grant a stacking attack-related buff until hit.
      skillPanelDescriptionOverride: "Inflict <b><color=#00FFED>Echo</color></b>
        DMG <b><color=#FFA500>1000%</color></b>+300% of own ATK\r\n\r\n<size=20><color=#C0C0C0>-
        When Hit, Decrease Enemy <b><color=#00FFED>Echo</color></b>DMG Resistance
        -15% for 10 seconds</color></size>\r\n<size=20><color=#C0C0C0>- After Yamidokoku,
        Self can perform a Follow-up \"Shin : Yaotome\"</color></size>\r\n<size=20><color=#C0C0C0>-
        When Ultimate, Grant <b><color=#00FFED>Blizzard</color></b> for 20 seconds<i><color=#C0C0C0>(Max
        2 stackable)</color></i>. During Ultimate, self will become Immunity to all
        Damage / Debuff, if Ultimate killed enemy, self will grant <b><color=#00FFED>Wind
        Frenzy</color></b> 1 stack per kill</color></size>\r\n<size=19><color=#00ffff>\u2022
        Blizzard: Increase All Stats +20%, When attack there 60% chance to spawn
        a Thunder Projectile that Deal additional <b><color=#00FFED>Echo</color></b> 
        DMG equal to 500% of own ATK</color></size>\r\n<size=19><color=#00ffff> \u2022
        Wind Frenzy: Increase ATK-Related Stat by 7%, Remove if owner got damaged</color></size>"
